WEBVTT


00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.880
89 days ago I arrived here with real in my pocket

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.280
and I didn't even imagine living it all bro

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:16.481
I cleaned windows

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:17.640
chairs

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.400
I passed with dog

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:20.960
I delivered flyers

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:22.240
sell truffle

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:27.080
and all this still sleeping inside 1 Chevette

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:30.400
Real until tomorrow

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:36.280
during this whole time I tried to create 1 business

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:37.600
parental authorization

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:40.880
1st were several ideas of failures

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:43.080
I thought I'd open a coffee

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:44.240
a pet shop

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:47.000
create a marketing agency inside the shed

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:50.880
but i realized they were all going to limit me

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:52.320
in physical space

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:56.480
not Kombi here

00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:58.360
I can travel around Brazil

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:01.360
and set up my mobile office

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:04.040
it was sleeping in chevas that i learned

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:07.640
that we don't need comfort to have courage

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:10.840
was cleaning windows and delivering flyers

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:12.000
that I also learned

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:14.720
that we don't need much to start

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:15.600
is on

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:17.120
I met Juninho

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:18.360
or

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:22.760
and I learned that family is not the blood that welcomes

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:26.600
there when i failed my first workshop

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:29.520
I learned that failure is not even the end

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:31.000
I desist that it is

00:01:31.001 --> 00:01:32.601
I got bigger rain here

00:01:32.602 --> 00:01:33.801
or is it closed

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:36.040
but that's it man

00:01:36.041 --> 00:01:39.361
and it was because of this failure that i created 1 movement

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:40.640
called

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:41.760
beatbox

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:49.800
it's been 90 days looking for a business I loved

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:51.280
when in fact

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:54.760
it was all right in front of me

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:58.360
if I were sure from day one

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:01.400
I wouldn't have lived and given up

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:05.000
everything I've experienced in these three months

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:10.680
and I wouldn't be here inside that bus either

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:13.440
and wouldn't have the courage to say

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:15.240
no

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:19.160
Education

